#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fix Model]
msgid ""
"Fix Model\n"
"Did you know that you can fix a corrupted 3D model to avoid a lot of slicing "
"problems on the Windows system?"
msgstr ""
"Reparer modell\n"
"Visste du at du kan reparere en skadet 3D-modell for å unngå mange "
"slicingproblemer på Windows?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Timelapse]
msgid ""
"Timelapse\n"
"Did you know that you can generate a timelapse video during each print?"
msgstr ""
"Timelapse\n"
"Visste du at du kan lage en timelapse-video under hver utskrift?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Arrange]
msgid ""
"Auto-Arrange\n"
"Did you know that you can auto-arrange all the objects in your project?"
msgstr ""
"Ordne automatisk\n"
"Visste du at du kan ordne alle objektene i prosjektet automatisk?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Orient]
msgid ""
"Auto-Orient\n"
"Did you know that you can rotate objects to an optimal orientation for "
"printing with a simple click?"
msgstr ""
"Autoorienter\n"
"Visste du at du kan rotere objekter til en optimal orientering for utskrift "
"med ett enkelt klikk?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Lay on Face]
msgid ""
"Lay on Face\n"
"Did you know that you can quickly orient a model so that one of its faces "
"sits on the print bed? Select the \"Place on face\" function or press the "
"<b>F</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Legg på flate\n"
"Visste du at du raskt kan orientere en modell slik at en av flatene ligger "
"på byggeplaten? Velg funksjonen «Plasser på flate» eller trykk på "
"<b>F</b>-tasten."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Object List]
msgid ""
"Object List\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts in a list and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Objektliste\n"
"Visste du at du kan se alle objekter/deler i en liste og endre "
"innstillingene for hvert objekt/hver del?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Search Functionality]
msgid ""
"Search Functionality\n"
"Did you know that you use the Search tool to quickly find a specific Orca "
"Slicer setting?"
msgstr ""
"Søkefunksjon\n"
"Visste du at du kan bruke søkeverktøyet til raskt å finne en bestemt "
"innstilling i Orca Slicer?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Simplify Model]
msgid ""
"Simplify Model\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce the number of triangles in a mesh using the "
"Simplify mesh feature? Right-click the model and select Simplify model."
msgstr ""
"Forenkle modell\n"
"Visste du at du kan redusere antall trekanter i et nett med funksjonen "
"Forenkle nett? Høyreklikk på modellen og velg Forenkle modell."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Slicing Parameter Table]
msgid ""
"Slicing Parameter Table\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts on a table and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Tabell over slicingparametere\n"
"Visste du at du kan se alle objekter/deler i en tabell og endre "
"innstillingene for hvert objekt/hver del?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split to Objects/Parts]
msgid ""
"Split to Objects/Parts\n"
"Did you know that you can split a big object into small ones for easy "
"colorizing or printing?"
msgstr ""
"Del i objekter/deler\n"
"Visste du at du kan dele et stort objekt i mindre objekter for enklere "
"fargelegging eller utskrift?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Subtract a Part]
msgid ""
"Subtract a Part\n"
"Did you know that you can subtract one mesh from another using the Negative "
"part modifier? That way you can, for example, create easily resizable holes "
"directly in Orca Slicer."
msgstr ""
"Trekk fra en del\n"
"Visste du at du kan trekke ett nett fra et annet med modifikatoren Negativ "
"del? På den måten kan du for eksempel lage hull med enkelt justerbar "
"størrelse direkte i Orca Slicer."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:STEP]
msgid ""
"STEP\n"
"Did you know that you can improve your print quality by slicing a STEP file "
"instead of an STL?\n"
"Orca Slicer supports slicing STEP files, providing smoother results than a "
"lower resolution STL. Give it a try!"
msgstr ""
"STEP\n"
"Visste du at du kan forbedre utskriftskvaliteten ved å slice en STEP-fil i "
"stedet for en STL?\n"
"Orca Slicer støtter slicing av STEP-filer, som gir jevnere resultater enn en "
"STL med lavere oppløsning. Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Z seam location]
msgid ""
"Z seam location\n"
"Did you know that you can customize the location of the Z seam, and even "
"paint it on your print, to have it in a less visible location? This improves "
"the overall look of your model. Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Plassering av Z-søm\n"
"Visste du at du kan tilpasse plasseringen av Z-sømmen, og til og med male "
"den på utskriften, slik at den havner på et mindre synlig sted? Det "
"forbedrer det generelle utseendet til modellen. Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fine-tuning for flow rate]
msgid ""
"Fine-tuning for flow rate\n"
"Did you know that flow rate can be fine-tuned for even better-looking "
"prints? Depending on the material, you can improve the overall finish of the "
"printed model by doing some fine-tuning."
msgstr ""
"Finjustering av flythastighet\n"
"Visste du at flythastigheten kan finjusteres for enda penere utskrifter? "
"Avhengig av materialet kan du forbedre den generelle overflatefinishen på "
"den utskrevne modellen med litt finjustering."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split your prints into plates]
msgid ""
"Split your prints into plates\n"
"Did you know that you can split a model that has a lot of parts into "
"individual plates ready to print? This will simplify the process of keeping "
"track of all the parts."
msgstr ""
"Del utskriftene dine i plater\n"
"Visste du at du kan dele en modell med mange deler i individuelle plater som "
"er klare til utskrift? Det gjør det enklere å holde oversikt over alle "
"delene."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height]
msgid ""
"Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height\n"
"Did you know that you can print a model even faster by using the Adaptive "
"Layer Height option? Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut raskere med adaptiv laghøyde\n"
"Visste du at du kan skrive ut en modell enda raskere med alternativet "
"Adaptiv laghøyde? Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Support painting]
msgid ""
"Support painting\n"
"Did you know that you can paint the location of your supports? This feature "
"makes it easy to place the support material only on the sections of the "
"model that actually need it."
msgstr ""
"Støttemaling\n"
"Visste du at du kan male hvor støttene skal være? Denne funksjonen gjør det "
"enkelt å plassere støttemateriale bare på de delene av modellen som faktisk "
"trenger det."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Different types of supports]
msgid ""
"Different types of supports\n"
"Did you know that you can choose from multiple types of supports? Tree "
"supports work great for organic models while saving filament and improving "
"print speed. Check them out!"
msgstr ""
"Ulike typer støtte\n"
"Visste du at du kan velge mellom flere typer støtte? Trestøtte fungerer "
"utmerket for organiske modeller, sparer filament og gir raskere utskrift. "
"Prøv dem!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Printing Silk Filament]
msgid ""
"Printing Silk Filament\n"
"Did you know that Silk filament needs special consideration to print "
"successfully? A higher temperature and lower speed are always recommended "
"for the best results."
msgstr ""
"Utskrift med silkefilament\n"
"Visste du at silkefilament krever spesiell oppmerksomhet for å skrives ut "
"vellykket? Høyere temperatur og lavere hastighet anbefales alltid for best "
"resultat."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Brim for better adhesion]
msgid ""
"Brim for better adhesion\n"
"Did you know that when printed models have a small contact interface with "
"the printing surface, it's recommended to use a brim?"
msgstr ""
"Brim for bedre heft\n"
"Visste du at det anbefales å bruke brim når utskrevne modeller har en liten "
"kontaktflate mot byggeplaten?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Set parameters for multiple objects]
msgid ""
"Set parameters for multiple objects\n"
"Did you know that you can set slicing parameters for all selected objects at "
"once?"
msgstr ""
"Angi parametere for flere objekter\n"
"Visste du at du kan angi slicingparametere for alle valgte objekter samtidig?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Stack objects]
msgid ""
"Stack objects\n"
"Did you know that you can stack objects as a whole one?"
msgstr ""
"Stable objekter\n"
"Visste du at du kan stable objekter som ett samlet objekt?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Flush into support/objects/infill]
msgid ""
"Flush into support/objects/infill\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce wasted filament by flushing it into "
"support/objects/infill during filament changes?"
msgstr ""
"Spyl inn i støtte/objekter/fyll\n"
"Visste du at du kan redusere filamentsvinn ved å spyle inn i "
"støtte/objekter/fyll under filamentbytte?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Improve strength]
msgid ""
"Improve strength\n"
"Did you know that you can use more wall loops and higher sparse infill "
"density to improve the strength of the model?"
msgstr ""
"Forbedre styrken\n"
"Visste du at du kan bruke flere vegglinjer og høyere tetthet på glissent "
"fyll for å forbedre styrken til modellen?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:When do you need to print with the printer door opened]
msgid ""
"When do you need to print with the printer door opened?\n"
"Did you know that opening the printer door can reduce the probability of "
"extruder/hotend clogging when printing lower temperature filament with a "
"higher enclosure temperature? There is more info about this in the Wiki."
msgstr ""
"Når bør du skrive ut med skriverdøren åpen?\n"
"Visste du at det å åpne skriverdøren kan redusere sannsynligheten for "
"tilstopping av ekstruder/hotend når du skriver ut filament med lavere "
"temperatur ved høyere kabinetttemperatur? Det finnes mer informasjon om "
"dette i wikien."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Avoid warping]
msgid ""
"Avoid warping\n"
"Did you know that when printing materials that are prone to warping such as "
"ABS, appropriately increasing the heatbed temperature can reduce the "
"probability of warping?"
msgstr ""
"Unngå vridning\n"
"Visste du at når du skriver ut materialer som er utsatt for vridning, som "
"ABS, kan en passende økning av sengetemperaturen redusere sannsynligheten "
"for vridning?"
